{
  "$schema": "../../../../../../schema/biome.schema.json",
  "realm": "nether",
  "inspiredBy": "BetterNether's magma land: cracked fields of magma between lava pools.",
  "differs": "Basalt deltas are grey basalt and blackstone; here the ground itself is magma, cracked with netherrack seams, broken by lava pools rimmed in obsidian, fires burn on the magma, and the air is a heavy red haze full of popping lava.",
